	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Et tuas et d. archigrammatei <placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName> literas die 24. februarii <placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>integre recepi agoque tibi gratias pro prestitio officio, quas etiam domino <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName ref="p2740">Roseto</persName> ex me referri summopere cupio.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Bene profecto vir ille informavit, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quid cum homine profugo agendum sit, si <placeName ref="l167">Geneve</placeName> deprehensus fuerit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Tu minime sis solicitus, quod amplius in hoc profanum negocium per me <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>rapiaris, cum prius feceris, quod ex te petere non admodum decorum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fuit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Attamen quia dominus <persName ref="p2740">Rosetus</persName> significat hominem fortassis istac <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>transeuntem carceri includi posse te pro me literis fideiubente, donec <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>iuri satisfieret, et iris istius formam literis inclusam mittat, penes <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>te stabit, an literis tuis pro me spondere voles.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Oro autem, ut spondeas; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ego fidem tuam absque omni detrimento tam rerum quam famę tuę plene <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>liberaturus sum, id quod sancte tibi promitto et sacramento confirmo.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>De civilegio autem urbis <placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName>, ut literę <persName ref="p2740">Roseti</persName> habent, nihil ad <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>me pervenit; possum autem facile coniicere talia esse et eiusmodi, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ex quibus omnibus actoribus istic pen endum sit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Propterea neque mihi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>difficile erit secundum ea actionem prosequi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu modo non gravare pro <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>me fideiubere, ut homo is eo perveniens detineatur; non licet <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ille ante bimestre non procul ab <placeName ref="l18">Augusta</placeName> visus et securitatem ad <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>transactionem nactus sit a quibusdam creditoribus, tamen nulla spes <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>subest, ut aes ablatum restituat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Comicia nunc ad finem spectare videntur; fructus autem eorum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>exilis esse censetur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Contributio contra <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> ex paupere vulgo <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>corradetur et male locabitur, pax simulabitur, gravamina <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>imperii proponebuntur, sed non tollentur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Cetera sunt in pristino <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>declinationis statu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Piissimi viri <persName ref="p1884">Lavateri</persName> obitum et ipse ex animo vehementer lugeo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Rele<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>vationem laborum et vitę eternę requiem illi gratulor et d. <persName ref="p8123">Georgio <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Müllero</persName> in locum suffecto omnia fausta precor, cui atque d. consuli <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p1419">Habio</persName>, archigrammateo, <persName ref="p8111">Petro Martyri</persName> totique collegio fratrum salutem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ex me nunciari meque illis commendari magnopere cupio.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>in amicitia persevera, ut soles.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonę</placeName> 24. februarii 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8354">G[eor<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>gius] Lętus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Si quid pepigero cum impostore <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>meo autsi alterius ero consilii, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>quam quod scripsi, statim tibi per <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>literas significabo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">[.<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>..] und hochgelerten herrn [..<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>. ]inger, vorgeern<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Antistes.</note> der kilchen, [..<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>.] sonders lieben herren <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>unnd freunnde.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">[<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Zu]<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>rch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Bemerkung von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Redditae demum <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>per chirurgum <placeName ref="l159">Froue<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nfeldensem</placeName> 19. aprilis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
